{
  "chapter": "human-in-the-loop/interrupts-vs-signals",
  "tier": "drill",
  "notes": [
    "Two mechanisms for the same pause, simulated against the same node.",
    "LangGraph re-executes: interrupt() raises out of the node, and on resume the node",
    "runs again from its first line. A node with N interrupts therefore executes N+1",
    "times, and an effect above an interrupt fires once per remaining pass.",
    "Temporal re-executes nothing. The workflow resumes at the condition and journalled",
    "activities return their recorded results.",
    "Re-entry is from the top of the outermost node, so a subgraph is not a boundary: the",
    "parent's work before the subgraph call runs again too, with no interrupt in sight."
  ],
  "programs": {
    "effect-above-the-interrupt": {
      "steps": [
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "issue_credit" },
        { "kind": "interrupt", "name": "approve" },
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "send_reply" }
      ]
    },
    "effect-below-the-interrupt": {
      "steps": [
        { "kind": "interrupt", "name": "approve" },
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "issue_credit" },
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "send_reply" }
      ]
    },
    "two-interrupts-in-one-node": {
      "steps": [
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "draft" },
        { "kind": "interrupt", "name": "approve_amount" },
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "issue_credit" },
        { "kind": "interrupt", "name": "approve_wording" },
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "send_reply" }
      ]
    },
    "an-interrupt-inside-a-subgraph": {
      "steps": [
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "record_inbound" },
        {
          "kind": "subgraph",
          "name": "agent_loop",
          "steps": [
            { "kind": "effect", "name": "query_warehouse" },
            { "kind": "interrupt", "name": "approve" },
            { "kind": "effect", "name": "send_reply" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "a-node-that-never-pauses": {
      "steps": [
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "get_order" },
        { "kind": "effect", "name": "send_reply" }
      ]
    },
    "a-node-that-does-nothing": { "steps": [] }
  },
  "cases": [
